tml">A year ago, Thailand granted long-staying refugees from Myanmar the right to work legally. Refugees and rights groups welcome the move but say the program's first year has exposed significant shortcomings.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>From delivery driver to global fame: A Korean writer's journey</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2ed6e872a9c61d1cf0259ddf0e657d50c79005454587bfe98c635f7448087c95</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:45:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T10:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/from-delivery-driver-to-global-fame-a-korean-writer-s-journey/a-79672757--a579002c20b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/from-delivery-driver-to-global-fame-a-korean-writer-s-journey/a-79672757?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">You Yeong-Gwang's The Rainfall Market tells the story of a mysterious, hidden shop that only opens when it rains. For a debut novel by an unknown author, it was a massive success.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Australian MP seriously hurt in suspected car attack</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e034d8a67f563946a15987597a96b060f8f693a4176e901366d4180219294810</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:45:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T10:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/australian-mp-seriously-hurt-in-suspected-car-attack/a-79697660--8ec3224c2b82.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/australian-mp-seriously-hurt-in-suspected-car-attack/a-79697660?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Helen Haines, an independent federal lawmaker, has been struck by a car in what Australia's prime minister has called an apparent attack.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Deepfakes, bots and distrust: How AI is shaping Israel's election</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a47f7d4b4bfd98ef5ef97f0f55eb0b334a7bca564b63da9d06b21087f203fbd1</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:45:45Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T08:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/deepfakes-bots-and-distrust-how-ai-is-shaping-israel-s-election/a-79657988--dfb913004f7f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/deepfakes-bots-and-distrust-how-ai-is-shaping-israel-s-election/a-79657988?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">For the first time, AI is playing a major role in Israel's elections. Observers warn that deepfakes, bots and influence campaigns could sway voters.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>What Earth's sixth mass extinction event means for humans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23dab582121162ffddbe9b6eb468fed135a0d0eb8074e988b2965e06d177f679</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:45:56Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T05:48:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-earth-s-sixth-mass-extinction-event-means-for-humans/a-79680410--0a12d110aea4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-earth-s-sixth-mass-extinction-event-means-for-humans/a-79680410?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Human activity is driving plants and animals to extinction at an unprecedented rate. As countries meet in Armenia to discuss ways to reverse nature loss, DW reveals how declining biodiversity is already harming people.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>France: Young voters blase about Glucksmann's Socialists</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e43c4c5787c638dde1692bf9a288a16ae79e542f9128c2b5a963aef0c941a303</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:44:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T13:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/france-young-voters-blase-about-glucksmann-s-socialists/a-79684159--5c98176d41f8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/france-young-voters-blase-about-glucksmann-s-socialists/a-79684159?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Raphael Glucksmann wants to lead France's Socialists to power without working with the left-populist Jean-Luc Melenchon, who is particularly popular with young voters. How can the center-left candidate win them over?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How reliant is Ukraine on the US-controlled Starlink internet service?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6e8631a1bb694cab85f88c16330f241f73f74526a52fad50b312437c810594e5</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:44:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T08:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-reliant-is-ukraine-on-the-us-controlled-starlink-internet-service/a-79689729--6217d664b01d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-reliant-is-ukraine-on-the-us-controlled-starlink-internet-service/a-79689729?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Kyiv keeps issuing warnings that the satellite internet system Starlink is being restricted in Ukraine. How dependent is the country on the system, and what would happen if it went down?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Populist Czech PM Babis goes empty-handed in Senate elections</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e605d9efb3e0290ae9e8f78eda1350270d1ab27167374aa0835458dbbaa146df</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:44:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T07:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/populist-czech-pm-babis-goes-empty-handed-in-senate-elections/a-79690934--95037aa1aa28.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/populist-czech-pm-babis-goes-empty-handed-in-senate-elections/a-79690934?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Opposition parties still control the Czech Senate, in a major blow to Prime Minister Andrej Babis' and his governing coalition.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Ilhan Omar: The US Democrat targeted by Donald Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8106b176ac566f951e296c53ffcd991f6046eae9674db600585e0ef1ed63e518</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:44:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T19:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445--0b2fbb5ba398.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/ilhan-omar-the-us-democrat-targeted-by-donald-trump/a-79688445?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump has described her as "garbage" and a "criminal" who does nothing but "bitch." Congress member Ilhan Omar has long been the target of angry verbal attacks from the US president. But why her?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>China's influence in the gaming industry is growing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e4ec03071008ac70e5c2571005a8adb12a06aa37fceebba762b348ca49b093d3</id><updated>2026-10-19T15:44:13Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755--447380e7608a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-s-influence-in-the-gaming-industry-is-growing/a-79484755?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Home to more than 700 million gamers, China is the world's largest gaming market — but it's also one of the most tightly regulated. The effects reach far beyond China, impacting players around the world.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
